Package: soteria
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Soteria development build <unreleased@soteria.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/Lfardell1/Soteria
Depends: bubblewrap (>= 0.8.0), systemd (>= 255), dbus, sudo
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
X-Soteria-Target: @TARGET@
X-Soteria-Runtime-Digest: @DIGEST@
X-Soteria-Source-Commit: @COMMIT@
X-Soteria-Package-Lock-SHA256: @LOCK@
Description: experimental disposable Linux terminal workspace
 Unsigned development package with separate fixed starter/engine and curated
 immutable distro runtime, including the non-root trusted entry verifier.
 Requires a supported systemd/cgroup-v2 host and explicit authorization.
 Not an anonymity system or a hostile-code security boundary. VM validation
 and release evidence are required before claiming a supported release.
